(6047106, 0, 'Tell me about gathering professions.', 'Tell me about gathering professions.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047108, 0, 'Gathering professions allow you to acquire raw materials used by production professions: gathering herbs; mining ore, stone, and jewels; or skinning beasts for their hides.\nYou can either support a related production profession with gathering, or simply sell the raw materials on the auction house.', 'Gathering professions allow you to acquire raw materials used by production professions: gathering herbs; mining ore, stone, and jewels; or skinning beasts for their hides.\nYou can either support a related production profession with gathering, or simply sell the raw materials on the auction house.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047142, 0, 'Tell me about Herbalism.', 'Tell me about Herbalism.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047130, 0, 'Herbalism allows you to locate and gather herbs from the wild. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Alchemy or Inscription professions.\nSkilled herbalists can also use their knowledge of the earth to heal themselves.', 'Herbalism allows you to locate and gather herbs from the wild. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Alchemy or Inscription professions.\nSkilled herbalists can also use their knowledge of the earth to heal themselves.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047145, 0, 'Tell me about Alchemy.', 'Tell me about Alchemy.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047133, 0, 'Alchemy allows you to use herbs and other materials to create a wide variety of useful elixirs, potions, oils, flasks and cauldrons. You\'ll also gain greater, longer-lasting benefits when using your own elixirs and flasks.\nHighly skilled alchemists may also transmute elemental materials and certain minerals for use by other production professions.\nAlchemy pairs well with Herbalism as it allows you to gather your own herbs.', 'Alchemy allows you to use herbs and other materials to create a wide variety of useful elixirs, potions, oils, flasks and cauldrons. You\'ll also gain greater, longer-lasting benefits when using your own elixirs and flasks.\nHighly skilled alchemists may also transmute elemental materials and certain minerals for use by other production professions.\nAlchemy pairs well with Herbalism as it allows you to gather your own herbs.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047149, 0, 'Tell me about Inscription.', 'Tell me about Inscription.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047138, 0, 'Inscription allows you to create magical scrolls, glyphs, off-hand tomes, Darkmoon cards, and even recipes for other professions.\nMany raw materials for Inscription come from milling herbs gathered by Herbalism, so the two professions pair well.\nYou\'ll need a Virtuoso Inking Set for inscribing things; this and other necessary materials, such as parchment, may be purchased from Inscription vendors.', 'Inscription allows you to create magical scrolls, glyphs, off-hand tomes, Darkmoon cards, and even recipes for other professions.\nMany raw materials for Inscription come from milling herbs gathered by Herbalism, so the two professions pair well.\nYou\'ll need a Virtuoso Inking Set for inscribing things; this and other necessary materials, such as parchment, may be purchased from Inscription vendors.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047113, 0, 'Train me in Inscription.', 'Train me in Inscription.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047107, 0, 'Tell me about production professions.', 'Tell me about production professions.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047129, 0, 'Production professions allow you to turn raw materials into items that you can use yourself, give to companions, or sell at an auction house.\nThey are often paired with a gathering profession so that you can gather your own raw materials, but it is possible to simply buy materials on the auction house.', 'Production professions allow you to turn raw materials into items that you can use yourself, give to companions, or sell at an auction house.\nThey are often paired with a gathering profession so that you can gather your own raw materials, but it is possible to simply buy materials on the auction house.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047146, 0, 'Tell me about Blacksmithing.', 'Tell me about Blacksmithing.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047134, 0, 'Blacksmithing allows you to forge items from metals, minerals and stones: melee weapons, mail and plate heavy armor, raw materials used by other production professions, and upgrades to pieces of equipment such as sharpening stones and shield spikes.\nHighly skilled blacksmiths can add a gem slot to their own bracers and gloves, as well as to their own or others\' belts. These gem slots may then be filled with magical gems that make the gemmed item more powerful.\nBlacksmithing pairs well with Mining as it allows you to gather your own ore and minerals.', 'Blacksmithing allows you to forge items from metals, minerals and stones: melee weapons, mail and plate heavy armor, raw materials used by other production professions, and upgrades to pieces of equipment such as sharpening stones and shield spikes.\nHighly skilled blacksmiths can add a gem slot to their own bracers and gloves, as well as to their own or others\' belts. These gem slots may then be filled with magical gems that make the gemmed item more powerful.\nBlacksmithing pairs well with Mining as it allows you to gather your own ore and minerals.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047143, 0, 'Tell me about Mining.', 'Tell me about Mining.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047131, 0, 'Mining allows you to locate and mine ore, minerals and stone from mining nodes in the wilderness and underground. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Blacksmithing, Engineering, or Jewelcrafting professions.\nSkilled miners also become tough and gain increased Stamina.\nYou\'ll need a Mining Pick in order to mine; this can be purchased from trade or Mining vendors.', 'Mining allows you to locate and mine ore, minerals and stone from mining nodes in the wilderness and underground. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Blacksmithing, Engineering, or Jewelcrafting professions.\nSkilled miners also become tough and gain increased Stamina.\nYou\'ll need a Mining Pick in order to mine; this can be purchased from trade or Mining vendors.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047148, 0, 'Tell me about Engineering.', 'Tell me about Engineering.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047137, 0, 'Engineering allows you to construct a wide variety of useful, amazing, and just plain weird items like rifles and scopes, motorcycles, and mechanical squirrels. However, many of these are only usable by yourself or other engineers, such as special goggles, mechanical additions to belts, boots, gloves and cloaks, and flying machines.\nMost raw Engineering materials are metals gathered by Mining, so the two professions pair well.\nMany creations require the use of a Blacksmith Hammer; this and other necessary materials, such as gun stocks or flux, may be purchased from trade or Engineering vendors.', 'Engineering allows you to construct a wide variety of useful, amazing, and just plain weird items like rifles and scopes, motorcycles, and mechanical squirrels. However, many of these are only usable by yourself or other engineers, such as special goggles, mechanical additions to belts, boots, gloves and cloaks, and flying machines.\nMost raw Engineering materials are metals gathered by Mining, so the two professions pair well.\nMany creations require the use of a Blacksmith Hammer; this and other necessary materials, such as gun stocks or flux, may be purchased from trade or Engineering vendors.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047150, 0, 'Tell me about Jewelcrafting.', 'Tell me about Jewelcrafting.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047139, 0, 'Jewelcrafting allows you to fashion magical rings, amulets, and trinkets as well as cut gems.\nThe gems used in Jewelcrafting may be purchased or acquired via Prospecting from ore gathered by Mining; for this reason the two professions pair well.\nMost Jewelcrafting designs also require a Jeweler\'s Kit while more advanced creations require a Simple Grinder; these may be purchased from Jewelcrafting vendors.', 'Jewelcrafting allows you to fashion magical rings, amulets, and trinkets as well as cut gems.\nThe gems used in Jewelcrafting may be purchased or acquired via Prospecting from ore gathered by Mining; for this reason the two professions pair well.\nMost Jewelcrafting designs also require a Jeweler\'s Kit while more advanced creations require a Simple Grinder; these may be purchased from Jewelcrafting vendors.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047147, 0, 'Tell me about Enchanting.', 'Tell me about Enchanting.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047136, 0, 'Enchanting allows you to enchant items with a wide variety of beneficial effects, as well as disenchant items and create magical wands and oils.\nHighly skilled enchanters can even enchant their own rings, which no one else may do.\nMost raw materials for Enchanting must be gathered via disenchanting, a process which destroys the disenchanted item. For this reason the profession pairs well with Tailoring, as you can disenchant the magical Tailoring items you create for raw materials.\nEnchanters may also place enchantments upon vellum, which allows the enchantment to be sold or saved for later use. Vellum and other useful Enchanting materials may be purchased from Enchanting vendors.', 'Enchanting allows you to enchant items with a wide variety of beneficial effects, as well as disenchant items and create magical wands and oils.\nHighly skilled enchanters can even enchant their own rings, which no one else may do.\nMost raw materials for Enchanting must be gathered via disenchanting, a process which destroys the disenchanted item. For this reason the profession pairs well with Tailoring, as you can disenchant the magical Tailoring items you create for raw materials.\nEnchanters may also place enchantments upon vellum, which allows the enchantment to be sold or saved for later use. Vellum and other useful Enchanting materials may be purchased from Enchanting vendors.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047111, 0, 'Train me in Enchanting.', 'Train me in Enchanting.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047152, 0, 'Tell me about Tailoring.', 'Tell me about Tailoring.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047141, 0, 'Tailoring allows you to fashion armor, cloaks, clothing, bags, spellthread, and other similar items from various types of cloth, which can be purchased or taken from slain humanoid enemies. Additional necessary materials such as threads and dyes can be purchased from trade or Tailoring vendors.\nHighly skilled tailors can also upgrade their cloaks with magical embroidery.\nEnchanters are often tailors as well, since they can disenchant the magical items they create.', 'Tailoring allows you to fashion armor, cloaks, clothing, bags, spellthread, and other similar items from various types of cloth, which can be purchased or taken from slain humanoid enemies. Additional necessary materials such as threads and dyes can be purchased from trade or Tailoring vendors.\nHighly skilled tailors can also upgrade their cloaks with magical embroidery.\nEnchanters are often tailors as well, since they can disenchant the magical items they create.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047151, 0, 'Tell me about Leatherworking.', 'Tell me about Leatherworking.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047140, 0, 'Leatherworking allows you to fashion armor, cloaks, armor-reinforcing kits, and other similar items from leather, hides, and scales. Other materials required for leatherworking can be purchased at trade and Leatherworking vendors.\nLeatherworking pairs well with Skinning as it allows you to gather your own raw materials; other necessary items, such as threads and dyes, can be purchased from trade or Leatherworking vendors.\nHighly skilled leatherworkers can also enforce their bracers and leg armor.', 'Leatherworking allows you to fashion armor, cloaks, armor-reinforcing kits, and other similar items from leather, hides, and scales. Other materials required for leatherworking can be purchased at trade and Leatherworking vendors.\nLeatherworking pairs well with Skinning as it allows you to gather your own raw materials; other necessary items, such as threads and dyes, can be purchased from trade or Leatherworking vendors.\nHighly skilled leatherworkers can also enforce their bracers and leg armor.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047144, 0, 'Tell me about Skinning.', 'Tell me about Skinning.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6047132, 0, 'Skinning allows you to remove and prepare the hides from slain creatures. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Leatherworking profession.\nSkilled Skinners also become masters of anatomy, increasing their chances to critically hit a target.\nYou\'ll need a Skinning Knife in order to skin creatures; this can be purchased from trade or Leatherworking vendors.', 'Skinning allows you to remove and prepare the hides from slain creatures. These can be sold at the auction house or used to support the Leatherworking profession.\nSkilled Skinners also become masters of anatomy, increasing their chances to critically hit a target.\nYou\'ll need a Skinning Knife in order to skin creatures; this can be purchased from trade or Leatherworking vendors.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049136, 0, 'Good to see you, $n!$B$BI just wanted to make sure that you appreciate all of the products that my genius has brought to the Kajaro Trading Company?$B$BThese include, but are not limited to: Kaja\'Cola, the Poultryizer, Town-In-A-Box, my Ingenious Cap of Mook Foolery, KTC Train-a-Tron Deluxe, the Amazing G-Ray, Never-Deflating Pool Ponies, the Big Ones, Warrior-Matic NX-01, and gilgoblins. No strike that last one. Under advice of counsel, I had nothing to do with them.$B$BAnyway, I\'m working on a few more things here that I think you\'ll find interesting, such as the Micro Mechachicken and a little something I like to call Subject Nine.', '', 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049135, 0, '', 'Hey. How ya doing, boss? Hobart and I are working on some things that will ensure that you have phenomenal backup products for when the kaja\'mite runs out.$B$BThere\'s only so much of it left down there in the mines, and when it\'s gone, all of the Kaja\'Cola is going to go with it, I\'m afraid.', 1, 273, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049175, 0, '', 'I don\'t talk to no $g scrub : trash;!', 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049176, 0, '', 'You\'re not quite in my league, honey.', 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049177, 0, '', 'I didn\'t talk to you back in school and I\'m sure not going to start now.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049178, 0, '', 'That\'s an interesting... "outfit" you\'re wearing.', 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049179, 0, '', 'Yes. I\'d love a refill. Fetch one and be quick about it.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049180, 0, '', 'This is the Trade Prince\'s party, sweetie. Invite only!', 396, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049181, 0, '', '$n, right? Word of advice: don\'t let the Trade Prince catch you around here. He knows you\'re after his job.$B$BEveryone knows.', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049182, 0, '', 'A mook?! I don\'t speak to brutes. How dare you!', 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049183, 0, '', 'What are we calling you things these days? Brutes? Hobgoblins?$B$BI can\'t keep it straight. Get out of here.', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049184, 0, '', 'You\'re big and strong. But you need a bath. Go jump in the pool.', 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049185, 0, '', 'Oh no you did not just talk to me!', 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049186, 0, '', 'What smells around here? Oh, that\'d be you.$B$BBeat it!', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049187, 0, '', 'What\'s your name?$B$BI guess it\'s a good thing you brutes can\'t talk. Otherwise, I\'d have to tell the Trade Prince how you annoyed me.$B$BNow scram!', 25, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049188, 0, '', 'Touch me one more time and I\'ll make sure that they send you to the Undermine!', 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049189, 0, '', 'Oh, you\'re just disgusting! Why is it always the ugly ones that try to pickup on me?!', 274, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595);
INSERT INTO `broadcast_text` (`ID`, `LanguageID`, `MaleText`, `FemaleText`, `EmoteID1`, `EmoteID2`, `EmoteID3`, `EmoteDelay1`, `EmoteDelay2`, `EmoteDelay3`, `SoundEntriesId`, `EmotesID`, `Flags`, `VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(6049198, 0, '<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$B$G Papa : Mama;...?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049216, 0, '<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BI hunger... therefore, I am.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049217, 0, '<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BWhat does "$c" mean? Are you the goblin $g patriarch : matriarch;?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049220, 0, '<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BThey call you $n. Is this your unique signifier, or is it an honorary title?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049224, 0, '<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BGreetings. I recently emerged from an egg. You?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049225, 0, '<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BIs it true that you cook your meat? Curious.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049226, 0, '<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BYou lack a helmet. Does this diminish your intellectual capacities?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049227, 0, '<To your astonishment, the Raptor hatchling is able to communicate with you.>$B$BThe ends of your fingers are dull and round. Is this why you carry around other implements for use in combat?$B$BHow interesting.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6007015, 0, 'Ye looking for Hogral?  Well did ye check the tavern?  Och!  If yer looking for a rogue, and a dwarf one at that, ye should start in the Inn!  Go have a look already.', 'Ye looking for Hogral?  Well did ye check the tavern?  Och!  If yer looking for a rogue, and a dwarf one at that, ye should start in the Inn!  Go have a look already.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6009684, 0, 'Seek out Shandrina in Silverwind Refuge.  She can sell you the "Expert Cookbook".', 'Seek out Shandrina in Silverwind Refuge.  She can sell you the "Expert Cookbook".', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6009686, 0, 'Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts.  To better yourself you will need to seek him out.', 'Dirge Quikcleave of Gadgetzan is a master of the culinary arts.  To better yourself you will need to seek him out.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6009688, 0, 'I can teach you how to cook!', 'I can teach you how to cook!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6009219, 0, 'Your skill exceeds mine, though  I\'ve heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of "The Bass and You".  That is sure to help you increase your skill.', 'Your skill exceeds mine, though  I\'ve heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of "The Bass and You".  That is sure to help you increase your skill.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6009556, 0, 'You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.', 'You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6009557, 0, 'I can teach you fishing skills.', 'I can teach you fishing skills.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6009699, 0, 'The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further.  He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks.', 'The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further.  He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6009700, 0, 'I\'ve heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your First Aid techniques.', 'I\'ve heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your First Aid techniques.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6009701, 0, 'I can train you in First Aid techniques.', 'I can train you in First Aid techniques.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6004714, 0, '%s looks up at you quizzically. Maybe you should inspect it?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6005140, 0, 'Skinning', 'Skinning', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6031493, 0, 'Scrying upon many insignificant situations within Icecrown, you stumble upon something interesting...', 'Scrying upon many insignificant situations within Icecrown, you stumble upon something interesting...', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6025215, 0, 'There is a noise from behind you!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6023540, 0, '$n\'s concoction is ruined.  A new one must be created from scratch.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6023071, 0, 'The failed concoction spills on the floor and appears to come to life!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036618, 0, '', 'Welcome back, $n.  You were fortunate.  Krennan\'s treatment doesn\'t always work this well on people who\'ve had the Curse as long as you.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6043954, 0, '', 'Haha! That should be a blast!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049018, 0, '', 'He\'ll get me more later? How are we supposed to get you promoted to Trade $g Prince : Princess; without our number one product on the shelves?!!!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049021, 0, '', 'Ace, Izzy, Gobber, you three make sure you tag along with $n and help $g him : her; take care of those deadbeats!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6037318, 0, '', 'Go get \'em, boss!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049015, 0, '', 'You better get upstairs pronto, boss. Trade Prince Gallywix is waiting for you.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049016, 0, '', '$n, you have to hurry and break your moolah out of the bank!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049071, 0, '', 'I can\'t stand to watch. So many good memories. So much profit.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6040278, 0, '', 'The Trade Prince\'s yacht is about to set sail. Everyone, get to the dock! Hand over the keys, boss. I\'m driving. Just let me know when you\'re ready to go.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036727, 0, '', 'It\'s not much, but it just might keep your green skin intact.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036728, 0, '', 'Just wanted to let you know that we\'re all counting on you!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036722, 0, '', 'Light be with you... for the very low price of a one silver tithe!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036779, 0, 'Would one of you hurry up and finish off the other? Some of us are trying to make some moolah here!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6048863, 0, 'I was just comin\' to see you. Honest!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035127, 0, 'Darn, you got me!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049019, 0, '', 'Ooh, I think you\'re gonna like this, boss!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6048504, 0, 'Use the Keys to the Hot Rod |TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_key_12.blp:32|t to get into your car. Pick up your friends, Izzy, Ace, and Gobber.', 'Use the Keys to the Hot Rod |TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_key_12.blp:32|t to get into your car. Pick up your friends, Izzy, Ace, and Gobber.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049020, 0, '', 'There they are! Okay, you three make sure that you help $g him : her; out today. $G He\'s : She\'s; got a lot of stuff to take care of before the party!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6048844, 0, 'Use your Hot Rod |TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_key_12.blp:32|t to run over Hired Looters and get their loot.', 'Use your Hot Rod |TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_key_12.blp:32|t to run over Hired Looters and get their Stolen Loot.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035129, 0, '', 'What? Fine, fine... I\'ll pay my protection moolah to your goons!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6048865, 0, '<Jack grunts something about the hammer being his weapon... you think.>', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035132, 0, '%s grunts and gives up, clearly beaten.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6048864, 0, 'I\'m tryin\' to run a business here!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035136, 0, 'Not the face, not the face!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6010677, 0, '%s becomes enraged!', '%s becomes enraged!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035166, 0, 'Stand your ground, men!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 19617, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035167, 0, 'Defeat these foul beasts!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 19618, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035168, 0, 'Protect the civilians!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 19619, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035169, 0, 'Push them back!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 19620, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035170, 0, 'Take heart, men!  We must protect our city!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 19621, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049023, 0, '', 'Make sure you pull plenty of moolah out of the bank. I don\'t want you buying any of that cheap clothing you usually like to wear. This party\'s important!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049012, 0, '', 'You\'re the most handsome boyfriend a girl could hope for. Knock \'em dead, honey!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035444, 0, 'You\'re dressed to impress! Use your new powers below to make your party guests happy!', 'You\'re dressed to impress! Use your new powers below to make your party guests happy!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049013, 0, 'Look at you! I\'m the luckiest boyfriend on the island!!!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6038602, 0, 'Enough!  I\'ve made up my mind.  We need Crowley on our side.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6038601, 0, 'We ought to leave Crowley in prison with those beasts!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049024, 0, 'You people cool your heels! $n is here. $G He\'s : She\'s; gonna be the next Trade $G Prince : Princess;!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6024357, 7, 'Next!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6040224, 0, 'If only I had someone to dance with.', 'If only I had someone to dance with.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6040223, 0, 'Ugh... I need a bucket!', 'Ugh... I need a bucket!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6040222, 0, 'I could really use a refill on my drink here.', 'I could really use a refill on my drink here.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6040225, 0, 'I love fireworks!', 'I love fireworks!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6040226, 0, 'This is delicious! Are there more hors d\'oeuvres?', 'This is delicious! Are there more hors d\'oeuvres?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035417, 0, 'A fresh glass of bubbly. Just what the doctor ordered, $n.', 'A fresh glass of bubbly. Just what the doctor ordered, $n.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035418, 0, 'Thanks for the refill, $g sir : ma\'am;!', 'Thanks for the refill, $g sir : ma\'am;!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035419, 0, 'This sparkling white wine is delicious! Wherever did you get it?', 'This sparkling white wine is delicious! Wherever did you get it?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035420, 0, 'I think this one will have to be my last. I\'m driving home after the party.', 'I think this one will have to be my last. I\'m driving home after the party.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035421, 0, 'Thanksh!', 'Thanksh!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035422, 0, 'I feel much better now...hic!', 'I feel much better now...hic!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035423, 0, 'Oh, my head hurtsh.', 'Oh, my head hurtsh.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035424, 0, 'Shorry about your shoes.', 'Shorry about your shoes.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035425, 0, 'A disco ball?! Groovy!', 'A disco ball?! Groovy!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035426, 0, 'How do you like my moves, $n?', 'How do you like my moves, $n?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035427, 0, 'We should totally have a pants-off dance-off!', 'We should totally have a pants-off dance-off!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035428, 0, 'Shake it like a goblinoid picture!', 'Shake it like a goblinoid picture!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035429, 0, 'Wow! That sure beats this puny, little sparkler!', 'Wow! That sure beats this puny, little sparkler!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035430, 0, 'You really stop at no expense, $n! Amazing!', 'You really stop at no expense, $n! Amazing!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035431, 0, 'Best... Party... Evar!', 'Best... Party... Evar!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035432, 0, 'Woo hoo, fireworks! More, more!', 'Woo hoo, fireworks! More, more!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035433, 0, 'Thanks. I was almost out. So hungry!', 'Thanks. I was almost out. So hungry!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035434, 0, 'These are the most delicious hors d\'oeurves I have ever tasted. You must share your recipe, $n!', 'These are the most delicious hors d\'oeurves I have ever tasted. You must share your recipe, $n!\n', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035435, 0, 'Finger licking good!', 'Finger licking good!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035436, 0, 'Nom, nom, nom!', 'Nom, nom, nom!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035450, 0, 'We be here courtesy o\' the trade prince.', 'We be here courtesy o\' the trade prince.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035449, 0, 'Let\'s have a dance!', 'Let\'s have a dance!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6035454, 0, 'Who be in charge here?', 'Who be in charge here?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6037243, 0, 'Is that you, $n? What are you doing away from headquarters? Get back to work!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6037246, 0, 'Drink Kaja\'Cola!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6037240, 0, 'What\'s this I hear about a party? I wasn\'t invited!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6037241, 0, 'You\'re all lazy! Get back to work. Especially you, $n!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6037244, 0, 'All hail the greatest trade prince on Azeroth... me!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6037245, 0, 'Thank you for your hard work and dedication. Unpaid overtime is approved for all!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6037242, 0, 'It\'s demotions for everyone if the Sharks beat the Buccaneers!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049041, 0, 'I not gonna take it anymore, mon!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049042, 0, 'Kezan for da trolls!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049039, 0, 'Ya got some nerve, mon!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049044, 0, 'Maybe I take dem bombs from ya an\' we see who go boom!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6038744, 0, '', 'This mastiff will help you find the hidden worgen.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 19696, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036092, 0, 'Keep them back!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 19712, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036091, 0, 'Fire!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 19710, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036090, 0, 'Hold the barricades!  Do not give them an inch!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 19709, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036106, 0, 'I\'ll stay behind with the Royal Guard, father.  It is my duty to Gilneas.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 19622, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036103, 0, 'We need to keep the worgen\'s attention in the city, Genn.  It\'s the only shot we have for the survivors to make it to Duskhaven.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 19507, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036104, 0, 'Not a chance, boy.  Gilneas is going to need its king\'s undivided attention.  Can\'t have your father wondering whether his child is alive or not.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 19508, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036105, 0, 'My men and I will hole up inside the Light\'s Dawn Cathedral.  I\'ve already given the order and the cannons are on their way.  Lead our people well, Genn.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 19509, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049827, 0, '', 'We need all of our bombs and tools to survive on this deserted island, $n.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6049832, 0, '', 'Dampwick\'s at the cave entrance just to the southeast.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6049835, 0, '', 'We need some new friends if we\'re going to survive all of this. Hopefully, the orcs won\'t just kill you on sight.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6046756, 0, 'Help!  Up here!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 20921, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049830, 0, 'The monkeys are going to get a kick out of those bananas!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6049831, 0, 'That was the most beautiful thing that I\'ve ever seen!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6049833, 0, 'The kaja\'mite has gone and made these monkeys smart! Keep that miner safe, $n.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6049834, 0, 'On behalf of the Bilgewater Cartel, I lay claim to this mine!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6049828, 0, '$n, you gotta get those teraptor hatchlings before they get us!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6049829, 0, 'Did you hear the matriarch growling up on the cliff? Steer clear of her!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6036348, 0, 'Taronto bosch!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036349, 0, 'Mkay, m\'ne ta oor!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036346, 0, 'Eekum Bokum!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049843, 0, '', 'Kilag Gorefang should be down the path to the west, goblin.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6049860, 0, '', 'Head back through the vale and meetup with Kilag at the Wild Overlook.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6049846, 0, 'Use your weed whacker to mow down these plants, little goblin!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6049855, 0, 'Go back to Aggra and tell her that we\'re moving northwest.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6036099, 0, 'We\'ve got Aranas!  Fire at will!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 19634, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036107, 0, 'If we can make it past the gates into Duskhaven we\'ll be safe.  The eastern mountains are virtually impassable.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 19719, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036108, 0, 'We were fools to take up arms against each other, Darius.  The worgen would\'ve never stood a chance.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 19720, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036517, 0, 'Use your Infrared Heat Focals!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049863, 0, 'Ride Bastia! Find Brax!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6036160, 0, 'Get to the gyrochoppa! Do it now!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036617, 0, 'Do exercise caution.  Don\'t expect anyone to invite you to their homes just yet.  But at least they won\'t shoot you outright.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036198, 0, 'Spirits of the sea, rise and lay waste to my enemies!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036200, 0, 'Children of the watery depths, lay waste to those who foul your realm!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036311, 0, 'Barrel smell like gunpowder...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 20909, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036310, 0, 'GAH!!!!  I CAN\'T SEE IN HERE!!!!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 20908, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036313, 0, 'Uh-oh... this gonna hurts me...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 20911, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036312, 0, 'This not be good...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 20910, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036314, 0, 'I gots bad feeling...', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 20912, 0, 1, 15595),
(6050651, 0, 'You must return to the Duskmist Shore!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6036325, 0, '', 'You are scary!  I just want my mommy!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036326, 0, '', 'Are you one of the good worgen, $g mister:ma\'am;?  Did you see Cynthia hiding in the sheds outside?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036324, 0, 'Don\'t hurt me!  I was just looking for my sisters!  I think Ashley\'s inside that house!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036632, 0, 'Hold your positions, men!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036633, 0, '', 'What\'s happening?!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036384, 0, 'I want you all to listen good... anyone who\'s not with me can start looking for a new job!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049864, 0, '', 'Uh oh, it\'s the Trade Prince.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6036418, 0, 'I... I thought I was a goner.  Thanks.', 'I... I thought I was a goner.  Thanks.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036417, 0, 'Thank you... *gasp*   I owe you my life.', 'Thank you... *gasp*   I owe you my life.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036419, 0, 'The land gave way from under our feet...  I thought I was dead.  I owe you one.', 'The land gave way from under our feet...  I thought I was dead.  I owe you one.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6036585, 0, 'By the Light!  This must be the end of the world!', 'By the Light!  This must be the end of the world!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049886, 0, 'Hurry, $n, deploy the Town-In-A-Box. Our people are trapped inside! Oh! I almost forgot your parachute.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6049888, 0, 'Hobart\'s right behind you, $g sir : ma\'am;.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6050081, 0, 'Remember, look for the pygmy leaders: Gaahl, Malmo, and Teloch.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6049824, 0, 'Yeah, there\'s tons of people still trapped in the escape pods, boss. Oh, wait. I guess you\'re not the boss anymore. Anyways, they\'re all probably going to drown if you don\'t get them out.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6038775, 0, 'On my way!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049025, 0, 'You gotta hurry, kid. We gotta get you into the game. But first, we gotta get the parts for that shredder!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049026, 0, 'Get into that shredder and win the game. The Bilgewater Cartel\'s counting on you!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049027, 0, 'You got the juice, kid. That\'s for sure! Too bad that dragon had to come and ruin everything. No matter. You made us proud. Now get back to headquarters.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049894, 0, 'It\'s really quite simple, $n. Just attach these fireworks to the wild cluckers and I\'ll use this controller to fly them into the cage.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6041262, 0, '$n, over here if you please.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049900, 0, 'Don\'t underestimate the Mechachicken, $n. After all, it is a Hobart Grapplehammer invention!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6038106, 0, 'Greely, load The Biggest Egg Ever into the Poultryizer. Mechnuggets for everyone!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6038170, 0, 'Shut it down, shut it down! The eggs are bad!!!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049934, 0, 'The marketing research Megs has conducted suggests that a naga invasion is imminent!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6050086, 0, 'Take your time, my $g boy : girl;. Now what can I modify this shredder boot to be? Hmm.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6050087, 0, 'I\'ve set the Bootzooka to fire several rockets per shot. I\'m fairly certain that I perfectly calibrated the targeting.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6050112, 0, 'Booster rockets for cages. What will I think of next? I am a genius!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6041261, 0, 'Hey, $n, come over here, would ya? I\'ve got something for you to do.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049899, 0, 'Now get us some real eggs.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6038119, 0, '', 'Genius idea, sir. Your brain power never ceases to amaze me!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6038141, 0, '', 'This thing is huge! Reverse the polarity on the Poultryizer. We\'ll have to shove it in through the outtake.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6038142, 0, '', 'There it goes.  It should only be a moment now....', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049911, 0, '', '$n, get to the Mechashark X-Steam Controller. Rid us of the Hammer menace!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6050082, 0, '', 'Look for the mounds of glowing stuff on the ground.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6050101, 0, '', 'Greely drools a little as she continues her mindless labor.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6050105, 0, '', 'Get rid of those Steamwheedle Sharks before they trounce us!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6050109, 0, '', 'It\'s time for a little sabotage!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6050111, 0, '', 'Deliver the footbomb uniform to the Slave Pits. Hurry, $n!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6036719, 0, '%s goes into a frenzy!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049948, 0, 'We can discuss the cut after you come back with the hides. I\'m thinking ninety-ten.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6049973, 0, '', '$n, hop into one of those B.C. Eliminators and wipe out the pygmies!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6049974, 0, '', 'You\'re going to have to take the fight to them, $n. Look for Izzy just outside their village.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6050013, 0, '', 'Those zombies are slow. You don\'t have to run right through them. Don\'t let them eat your brains, $n!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6050095, 0, '', 'Goblin grenades versus gnomish land mines. Show them who\'s better, $n!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6050097, 0, '', 'I forget... did you take flying lessons back on Kezan?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6050099, 0, '', 'Better hurry up, $n. I think that Thrall has news on where our people are being held.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6050114, 0, '', 'First she left you for Chip, and now the Trade Prince! She was never good enough for you, $n.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6043948, 0, '', '$n, get into the Ultimate Footbomb Uniform behind you and get down to the docks. Help Thrall kick the Trade Prince\'s butt!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6038644, 0, 'Bull\'s-eye!', 'Bull\'s-eye!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6038646, 0, 'What do you think? Zombie Kill of the Week?', 'What do you think? Zombie Kill of the Week?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6038645, 0, 'Ooh, that\'s gotta hurt!', 'Ooh, that\'s gotta hurt!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6038773, 0, 'That hurt!', 'That hurt!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6038766, 0, 'Doc!', 'Doc!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6037330, 0, 'Chocolate-flavored vanilla!', 'Chocolate-flavored vanilla!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6037360, 0, 'Invisible condiments. For an unobstructed view of your food.', 'Invisible condiments. For an unobstructed view of your food.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6037359, 0, 'Giant gnomes. No, wait... tiny giants!', 'Giant gnomes. No, wait... tiny giants!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6037361, 0, 'Shoes with wheels on them. And gloves with wheels - for when you fall down.', 'Shoes with wheels on them. And gloves with wheels - for when you fall down.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6037414, 0, 'Mom detectors.', 'Mom detectors.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6037332, 0, 'Headshoes!', 'Headshoes!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6037423, 0, 'Mouse-sized beartraps... no... Bear-sized mousetraps!!', 'Mouse-sized beartraps... no... Bear-sized mousetraps!!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6037416, 0, 'Recycling! But, for stuff that\'s never been used before.', 'Recycling! But, for stuff that\'s never been used before.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049938, 0, '', 'You hear that, naga? $n is on $g his : her; way to settle our "negotiations"!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6049951, 0, '', 'Everybody loves a pool pony. It\'s our fastest selling toy behind the Kablooey Bombs: Infant Edition.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6044571, 0, '', 'That pygmy helm should fool them, at least for a little while. Get back to town!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6050108, 0, 'I never liked that guy. He stole your girlfriend. I say, good riddance!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
(6038338, 0, 'WHO DARES?!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 18042, 15, 1, 15595),
(6038346, 0, 'Little goblins? I remember when your race was created.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 15595),
(6038349, 0, 'I care nothing for your threats or these naga. Prepare to be removed from existence.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 25, 1, 15595),
(6038359, 0, 'Now, young $n, you will die!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 18042, 0, 1, 15595),
(6039240, 0, '', 'Okay. We\'re going to move away from the exploding volcano and try to hook up with the orcs for the final assault on the Trade Prince. See you on the other side... I hope.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6038572, 0, 'The other captives are up in the volcano... they\'re being sacrificed, or worse, zombiefied!', 'The other captives are up in the volcano... they\'re being sacrificed, or worse, zombiefied!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 15595),
(6038570, 0, 'I really can\'t thank you enough!', 'I really can\'t thank you enough!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 18, 1, 15595),
(6038568, 0, 'They were trying to change me into a zombie!!!', 'They were trying to change me into a zombie!!!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 15595),
(6038571, 0, 'They took the others up into the volcano. Some to turn into zombies, some to sacrifice to their turtle god, Volcanoth!', 'They took the others up into the volcano. Some to turn into zombies, some to sacrifice to their turtle god, Volcanoth!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5, 1, 15595),
(6050007, 0, '', '$n, you gotta get in there and rescue our people!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15595),
