(6039543, 0, 'I\'m your goblin, Thrall. What would you have of me?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6039589, 0, 'It will be as you say! Long live the Bilgewater Cartel! For the Horde!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6039585, 0, 'Thrall grunts and thinks a moment on what to do with the Trade Prince.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6039586, 0, 'For now, you will remain the Trade Prince of the Bilgewater Cartel.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6039587, 0, 'I will send a representative from amongst your people to the new warchief, Garrosh Hellscream in Orgrimmar.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6039588, 0, 'You will have a new home in Azshara and the Bilgewater Cartel will become a part of the Horde!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049101, 0, 'Prepare the Micro Mechachicken!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049103, 0, '', 'There. One Micro Mechachicken. I\'ll never understand how you come up with these names.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049107, 0, 'Excellent. Now back away from the Ultra Concave Fissionable Testing Platform. Slowly, if you please.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049108, 0, 'Thank you. Now behold as I stabilize the highly unstable miniaturization process.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049110, 0, 'I am going to end the horrible problem of food storage cutting into the profits of the Bilgewater Cartel!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049111, 0, 'I\'ll soon be revered as the greatest goblin tinker of all time! Besides, that negligence case involving the creation of the gilgoblins will never stick.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049112, 0, 'Flip the switch!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049115, 0, 'Quite right, Greely. You passed today\'s pop quiz.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049116, 0, 'I am now flipping the switch!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049117, 0, 'Greely, can you feel it? My moment of success is at hand!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049118, 0, 'Grocery store owners everywhere will owe me a percentage of their profits!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049119, 0, 'I\'m flipping the second switch!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049120, 0, 'Wait... something\'s wrong!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049122, 0, 'I know... I know! Where\'s the override? The override?!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049124, 0, 'Here goes nothing. I always loved you, Greely!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049125, 0, 'Flipping the override switch now!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049127, 0, 'Are we still alive?', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049129, 0, 'Well of course we are, my dear Greely. And look there. The Micro Mechachicken\'s stabilization appears to be a complete success!', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049133, 0, 'I haven\'t the foggiest notion what you\'re talking about, Miss Greely.', '', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049102, 0, '', 'You don\'t have to yell, Hobart, I\'m standing right here. Sheesh!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049105, 0, '', 'Greely sighs and rolls her eyes.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049106, 0, '', 'Yes, Doctor Grapplehammer.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049109, 0, '', 'The assistant shakes her head.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049113, 0, '', 'Greely coughs.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049114, 0, '', 'Um, Hobart, you\'re at the controls.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049121, 0, '', 'Ya think? Hobart, the Micro Mechachicken is destablizing. It\'s expanding!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049123, 0, '', 'It\'s the one on the far right! Hurry, Hobart! It\'s going to eggsplode!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049126, 0, '', 'WHAT?!!!', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049128, 0, '', 'We\'re still alive, Doctor Grapplehammer, despite your best efforts.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049131, 0, '', 'Is that egg on your face?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049132, 0, '', 'Now what\'s this about you \'always loved me\', Grapplehammer?', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595),
(6049134, 0, '', 'We can both agree on that, doctor.', 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 15595);
